## TeamMembershipController tests — skip SETUP if teams.http was already run
## adminToken=admin | managerToken=Lynx (no team after setup) | memberWithoutATeamToken=manager of Team Test
## memberWithoutATeam2=user without team | memberWithATeamToken=Rogue (member TEAM_ALPHA)

## SETUP
### Create Team Test
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

{"name": "Team Test"}

### Make Rogue co-manager so Lynx can leave TEAM_ALPHA
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/1/second-manager/2
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### Lynx leaves TEAM_ALPHA
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/1/leave
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

## Tests for all TeamMembershipController endpoints

## POST /teams/memberships/{teamId}/membership — Join a team

### [OK 201] Join — memberWithoutATeam2 sends a request to Team Test
## After this test: memberWithoutATeam2 has a PENDING membership
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/membership
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [KO 400] Join — manager tries to join their own team
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/membership
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [KO 400] Join — memberWithoutATeam2 tries to join a second time (request already pending)
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/membership
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [KO 403] Join — unauthenticated visitor
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/membership

### [KO 404] Join — non-existent team
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/999999/membership
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

## GET /teams/memberships/me — Current user membership

### [KO 401] My membership — non authentifié
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/me

### [OK 200] My membership — memberWithoutATeam2 has a PENDING request
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/me
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [OK 200] My membership — Lynx has no request and no team
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/me
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

## GET /teams/memberships/{teamId}/members — Team members

### [OK 200] Members of Team Test — unauthenticated visitor (emails hidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/members
Accept: application/json

### [OK 200] Members of Team Test — memberWithoutATeam2 logged in but not manager (emails hidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/members
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [OK 200] Members of Team Test — manager (emails visible)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/members
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [OK 200] Members of Team Test — admin (emails visible)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/members
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{adminToken}}

### [KO 404] Members — non-existent team
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/999999/members
Accept: application/json

## GET /teams/memberships/{teamId}/requests — Pending requests

### [OK 200] Pending requests — manager sees memberWithoutATeam2's request
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/requests
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [KO 403] Pending requests — unauthenticated
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/requests

### [KO 403] Pending requests — simple member (not manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/requests
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [KO 404] Pending requests — non-existent team
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/999999/requests
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

## PATCH /teams/memberships/{membershipId}/accept — Accept a request

### [KO 403] Accept — non-manager tries to accept memberWithoutATeam2's request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/4/accept
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [KO 404] Accept — non-existent membership
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/999999/accept
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [OK 200] Accept — manager accepts memberWithoutATeam2's request
## After this test: memberWithoutATeam2 is ACCEPTED in Team Test
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/4/accept
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

## PATCH /teams/memberships/{membershipId}/refuse — Refuse a request

### [OK 201] Join — managerToken sends a request to Team Test
## After this test: managerToken has a PENDING membership
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/membership
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### [KO 403] Refuse — non-manager tries to refuse managerToken's request
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/5/refuse?reason=Tag+already+used
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [KO 404] Refuse — membership inexistant
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/999999/refuse?reason=test
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [OK 200] Refuse — manager refuses managerToken's request with a reason
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/5/refuse?reason=Tag+already+used
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

## DELETE /teams/memberships/{membershipId} — Exclure un membre accepté
## Prérequis: memberWithoutATeam2 est ACCEPTED dans Team Test (membership id=4)
### [KO 401] Delete — non authentifié
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/4

### [KO 403] Delete — utilisateur non manager (memberWithoutATeam2 essaie de s'exclure lui-même)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/4
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [KO 404] Delete — membership inexistant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/999999
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [OK 204] Delete — manager exclut memberWithoutATeam2 de Team Test
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/4
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

